05:38.560 --> 05:40.480
And you bring up an excellent point.

05:40.480 --> 05:42.240
So as we can see here, right now the code

05:42.240 --> 05:44.680
is fairly short, easy to follow.

05:44.680 --> 05:46.920
But you can imagine it's very easy for a team

05:46.920 --> 05:48.520
