07:35.040 --> 07:36.760
The main difference being that, one,

07:36.760 --> 07:38.320
is being called by a function.

07:38.320 --> 07:40.600
But the second part, which is actually really important,

07:40.600 --> 07:42.320
is that if you wanted to actually use the prop

07:42.320 --> 07:45.360
in your computation, say, for instance,

07:45.360 --> 07:47.880
inside of this computed, we wanted to actually say

